    "detailed_description": "Set in a time when the intelligent machines have taken over everything but wanted more;<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn a bid to harness the power of the human mind, an all-powerful AI lured and trapped everyone within the cyber realm.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe Deviants are a very rare set of people in this realm that have evolved to become unaffected by the mind control of the all-powerful AI. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou play as a deviant in this world as you set out to put an end to this madness.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou will have the ability to run, jump, swim, fly, control time, use and override portals, as you embark on the mission to free everyone and escape the cyber realm.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDeviant-X is a 2D vertical-scrolling puzzle platforming adventure that explores this Deviants vs AI saga.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDeveloped by Zerocape Studios - a small independent studio from Akure, Nigeria.",
    "about_the_game": "Set in a time when the intelligent machines have taken over everything but wanted more;<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn a bid to harness the power of the human mind, an all-powerful AI lured and trapped everyone within the cyber realm.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe Deviants are a very rare set of people in this realm that have evolved to become unaffected by the mind control of the all-powerful AI. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou play as a deviant in this world as you set out to put an end to this madness.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou will have the ability to run, jump, swim, fly, control time, use and override portals, as you embark on the mission to free everyone and escape the cyber realm.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDeviant-X is a 2D vertical-scrolling puzzle platforming adventure that explores this Deviants vs AI saga.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDeveloped by Zerocape Studios - a small independent studio from Akure, Nigeria.",
    "short_description": "You are a deviant trapped in a hostile cyber realm by an all-powerful AI, make your way through challenging areas filled with dangerous bots and larger-than-life creatures, as you set out to free everyone else and escape back\u00a0to\u00a0reality.",
